        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glass etching plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glass etching plant
Infrastructure of a glass etching plant.;
UUID: 97ba85a3-9362-3223-836a-bfa84186eb5a
Infrastructure of a glass etching plant with data for land use and area of buildings. No data for machinery. Annual capacity normalized to 100000 m2/a.
Location: Production plant in DK. Building background data from CH.
Technology: Infrastructure of a plant for the anti reflex etching process.
Time period: Date of estimation.
Production volume: 100000 m2/a coated glass.
Sampling: Questionnaire. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_97ba85a3-9362-3223-836a-bfa84186eb5a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
